function updateExpenseOwners(){let f=$('#expenseForm');if(!f)return;let src=f.elements.source.value;setChoiceOptions(f.elements.owner,expenseOwners(src),'請選擇單位');updateExpenseCategories();updateExpenseSubjects('')}
function updateExpenseCategories(){let f=$('#expenseForm');if(!f)return;setChoiceOptions(f.elements.category,expenseCategories(f.elements.source.value,f.elements.owner.value),'請選擇經費屬性')}
function updateExpenseSubjects(selected){let f=$('#expenseForm');if(!f)return;let el=f.elements.subject;if(selected!==undefined&&selected!==el.value)el.value=selected;const source=f.elements.source.value,owner=f.elements.owner.value,category=f.elements.category.value,preferred=new Set(budgets().filter(x=>x.source===source&&x.owner===owner&&x.category===category).map(x=>x.subject));setChoiceOptions(el,expenseSubjects(source,owner,category),'請選擇預算科目',preferred)}

function updateExpenseLimit(){const f=$('#expenseForm');if(!f)return;const id=Number(f.elements.id.value||0),owner=f.elements.owner.value,source=f.elements.source.value,subject=f.elements.subject.value,category=f.elements.category.value,amt=numericMoney(f.elements.amount),all=expenses().filter(x=>!x.voided&&x.id!==id),line=budgets().find(x=>x.source===source&&x.owner===owner&&x.subject===subject&&x.category===category),lineSpent=all.filter(x=>x.budget_item_id===line?.id).reduce((s,x)=>s+x.amount,0),lineBalance=line?line.budget-lineSpent:0,lineReserved=line?.reserved_out||0,groupBudget=budgets().filter(x=>x.owner===owner&&x.source===source&&x.category===category).reduce((s,x)=>s+x.budget,0),groupSpent=all.filter(x=>x.owner===owner&&x.source===source&&x.category===category).reduce((s,x)=>s+x.amount,0),reserved=(S.data.transfers||[]).filter(x=>x.status==='planned'&&x.from_owner===owner&&x.source===source&&x.from_category===category&&x.from_budget_item_id&&Number(x.amount)>0).reduce((s,x)=>s+Number(x.amount),0),available=Math.max(0,groupBudget-groupSpent-reserved),lineAvailable=Math.max(0,lineBalance-lineReserved),limit=lineReserved>0?Math.min(lineAvailable,available):available;let el=$('#expenseLimit');if(!el)return;const ready=!!(owner&&source&&category),hasReservation=lineReserved>0,groupLabel=`${esc(owner)}／${esc(source)}／${esc(category)} 剩餘 ${money(available)} 元`;let text='';if(ready){if(line){if(hasReservation){const label=lineAvailable<=available?`此預算明細扣除規劃圈存後餘額；未扣圈存餘額 ${money(Math.max(0,lineBalance))} 元`:groupLabel;text+=`最多可核銷：<b>${money(limit)}</b> 元（${label}）<br><span>此科目有規劃圈存，不可超支。若要超支，請先調降或刪除該筆規劃流用。</span>`}else if(lineBalance<=available)text+=`不超支可核銷：<b>${money(Math.max(0,lineBalance))}</b> 元（此預算明細餘額）<br>含超支最多可核銷：<b>${money(available)}</b> 元（${groupLabel}）`;else text+=`最多可核銷：<b>${money(available)}</b> 元（${groupLabel}）`}else text+=`含超支最多可核銷：<b>${money(available)}</b> 元（${groupLabel}）`}if(amt>limit)text+='<br><span class="negative">目前金額超過上限。</span>';else if(line&&!hasReservation&&amt>Math.max(0,lineBalance))text+='<br>將造成科目超支，可之後以流用補足。';el.innerHTML=text}
function payeeRow(x){return `<div class="payee-row"><input name="payee_name" pattern="[^;；]*" title="請勿於付款對象名稱內輸入分號" autocomplete="off" placeholder="付款對象（選填）" aria-label="付款對象（選填）" value="${esc(x.name)}"><input name="payee_amount" class="money-input" data-money="1" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="分配金額（選填）" aria-label="分配金額（選填）" value="${esc(x.amount)}"><button type="button" class="smallbtn" onclick="this.parentElement.remove();updatePayeeSum()">×</button></div>`}
function addPayee(){ $('#payeeRows').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',payeeRow({name:'',amount:''}));updatePayeeSum() }
function updatePayeeSum(){let sum=$$('.payee-row [name=payee_amount]').reduce((s,x)=>s+numericMoney(x),0),want=numericMoney($('#expenseForm [name=amount]'));let n=$('#payeeSum');if(n)n.textContent=`已分配 ${money(sum)} 元${want?`／核銷金額 ${money(want)} 元`:''}`}
function transferOutOwners(source,old=null,includeUnavailable=false){const values=budgets().filter(x=>x.source===source&&(includeUnavailable||x.available_balance>0)).map(x=>x.owner);if(old&&old.source===source)values.push(old.from_owner);return [...new Set(values)].filter(Boolean).sort()}
function transferOutAttributes(source,owner,old=null,includeUnavailable=false){const values=budgets().filter(x=>x.source===source&&x.owner===owner&&(includeUnavailable||x.available_balance>0)).map(x=>x.category);if(old&&old.source===source&&old.from_owner===owner)values.push(old.from_category);return [...new Set(values)].filter(Boolean).sort()}
function transferOutSubjects(source,owner,category,old=null,includeUnavailable=false){const items=budgets().filter(x=>x.source===source&&x.owner===owner&&x.category===category&&(includeUnavailable||x.available_balance>0));if(old&&old.source===source&&old.from_owner===owner&&old.from_category===category&&!items.some(x=>x.subject===old.from_subject))items.push({subject:old.from_subject,available_balance:0});return [...new Map(items.filter(x=>x.subject).sort((a,b)=>Number(b.available_balance||0)-Number(a.available_balance||0)||a.subject.localeCompare(b.subject,'zh-Hant')).map(x=>[x.subject,x])).values()].map(x=>x.subject)}
function transferTargetSubjects(source,category,old=null){const values=budgets().filter(x=>x.source===source&&x.category===category).map(x=>x.subject);if(old&&old.source===source&&old.to_category===category)values.push(old.to_subject);return [...new Set(values)].filter(Boolean).sort()}
function transferBudget(source,owner,category,subject){return budgets().find(x=>x.source===source&&x.owner===owner&&x.category===category&&x.subject===subject)}
